    body = charToRaw("[{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/53\",\"repository_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta\",\"labels_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/53/labels{/name}\",\"comments_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/53/comments\",\"events_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/53/events\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/53\",\"id\":2881094031,\"node_id\":\"I_kwDOBZkC0M6rugGP\",\"number\":53,\"title\":\"`nc_prj_to_gridmapping` not working with UTM projections?\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"MalditoBarbudo\",\"id\":4775311,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzUzMTE=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4775311?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/MalditoBarbudo\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/MalditoBarbudo/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"labels\":[],\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"assignees\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"comments\":12,\"created_at\":\"2025-02-26T10:37:45Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-29T06:47:55Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"assignee\":null,\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"issue_field_values\":[],\"type\":null,\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"sub_issues_summary\":{\"total\":0,\"completed\":0,\"percent_completed\":0},\"issue_dependencies_summary\":{\"blocked_by\":0,\"total_blocked_by\":0,\"blocking\":0,\"total_blocking\":0},\"body\":\"Sorry if this has been reported/asked before, I didn't find anything in the other issues or the docs.\\nSeems like when CRS is in UTM projection no mapping is available, even if UTM should be recognised as transverse mercator grid mapping if I'm not mistaken. See reprex below:\\n\\n``` r\\nlibrary(ncmeta)\\nlibrary(sf)\\n#> Linking to GEOS 3.12.1, GDAL 3.8.4, PROJ 9.3.1; sf_use_s2() is TRUE\\nlibrary(stringr)\\nst_crs(25830)$proj4string\\n#> [1] \\\"+proj=utm +zone=30 +ellps=GRS80 +towgs84=0,0,0,0,0,0,0 +units=m +no_defs\\\"\\nnc_prj_to_gridmapping(st_crs(25830)$proj4string)\\n#> Warning in prepCRS(prj): no available mapping to netcdf projection, returning\\n#> empty crs list\\n#> # A tibble: 0 × 2\\n#> # ℹ 2 variables: name <chr>, value <list>\\nfoo <- st_crs(25830)$proj4string\\nbar <- stringr::str_replace(foo, \\\"utm\\\", \\\"tmerc\\\")\\nnc_prj_to_gridmapping(bar)\\n#> # A tibble: 9 × 2\\n#>   name                             value    \\n#>   <chr>                            <list>   \\n#> 1 grid_mapping_name                <chr [1]>\\n#> 2 latitude_of_projection_origin    <dbl [0]>\\n#> 3 longitude_of_central_meridian    <dbl [0]>\\n#> 4 scale_factor_at_central_meridian <dbl [0]>\\n#> 5 false_easting                    <dbl [0]>\\n#> 6 false_northing                   <dbl [0]>\\n#> 7 semi_major_axis                  <dbl [1]>\\n#> 8 inverse_flattening               <dbl [1]>\\n#> 9 longitude_of_prime_meridian      <dbl [1]>\\n```\\n\\n<sup>Created on 2025-02-26 with [reprex v2.1.1](https://reprex.tidyverse.org)</sup>\\n\\nAm I wrong in assuming this and UTM projections are not allowed?\\n\",\"closed_by\":null,\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/53/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"timeline_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/53/timeline\",\"performed_via_github_app\":null,\"state_reason\":null,\"pinned_comment\":null},{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/52\",\"repository_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta\",\"labels_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/52/labels{/name}\",\"comments_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/52/comments\",\"events_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/52/events\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/52\",\"id\":2321656414,\"node_id\":\"I_kwDOBZkC0M6KYape\",\"number\":52,\"title\":\"Compatibility with a zarr back end.\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"dblodgett-usgs\",\"id\":1492803,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTI4MDM=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1492803?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/dblodgett-usgs\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"labels\":[],\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"assignees\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"comments\":22,\"created_at\":\"2024-05-28T18:13:34Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-02-19T22:34:47Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"assignee\":null,\"author_association\":\"CONTRIBUTOR\",\"issue_field_values\":[],\"type\":null,\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"sub_issues_summary\":{\"total\":0,\"completed\":0,\"percent_completed\":0},\"issue_dependencies_summary\":{\"blocked_by\":0,\"total_blocked_by\":0,\"blocking\":0,\"total_blocking\":0},\"body\":\"I've been playing with the new `pizzarr` package (https://github.com/keller-mark/pizzarr) in a package called `rnz` (https://github.com/DOI-USGS/rnz) -- So far, `rnz` implements the read side of the `RNetCDF` functions. \\r\\n\\r\\nI am going to play with this in a fork but wanted to run the idea by you @mdsumner. If we were to create ncmeta functions that wrap open.nc, close.nc, file.inq.nc, and att.get.nc, we could call a zarr back end basically seamlessly with what I've worked up in `rnz`. When this is all up on CRAN, would you be interested in such a set up?\",\"closed_by\":null,\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/52/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"timeline_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/52/timeline\",\"performed_via_github_app\":null,\"state_reason\":null,\"pinned_comment\":null},{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/51\",\"repository_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta\",\"labels_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/51/labels{/name}\",\"comments_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/51/comments\",\"events_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/51/events\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/pull/51\",\"id\":2074727547,\"node_id\":\"PR_kwDOBZkC0M5jtDE8\",\"number\":51,\"title\":\"Update DESCRIPTION\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"olivroy\",\"id\":52606734,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNjA2NzM0\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52606734?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/olivroy\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/olivroy\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/olivroy/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/olivroy/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.c